Package: poclp
Type: Package
Title: Probabilities of Causation by Linear Programming
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Marek", "Deja", email = "marek.deja@uj.edu.pl",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0015-2322"))
Description: Computes sharp bounds on the probability of necessity and
    sufficiency, the probability of necessity and the probability of
    sufficiency from observational and experimental distributions by the
    response-type linear program, solved in Zig through the rzig package.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: Zig 0.16.x or 0.17.x
